WEBVTT

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.693
The scale of these problems though

00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:35.448
is even more reason
why we should be optimistic.

00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:39.911
Because what we know is that in the past,

00:00:39.911 --> 00:00:42.955
every great and difficult thing
that has been accomplished,

00:00:42.955 --> 00:00:44.540
every breakthrough,

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.754
has in fact required

00:00:49.754 --> 00:00:52.507
a very strong sense of optimism

00:00:52.507 --> 00:00:53.674
that it was possible.

00:00:54.008 --> 00:00:56.302
Think of the first airplanes.

00:00:57.261 --> 00:00:58.262
It’s hard enough

00:00:58.262 --> 00:01:04.018
to create something good and great
deliberately and with intention.